 "two_real_defects_found_today_that_no_criterion_asked_about_directly": {
  "OOS_leak": "The global train/OOS boundary reserved a flat 120 bars and its own comment called that 'zero leakage'. Phase 3A picks each regime's exit horizon from a candidate list topping out at 150 bars, and a label resolves over that horizon -- so any regime calibrated above 120 had its TRAINING labels resolving inside the OOS window, in the one measurement the arm decision rests on. Fixed in WARRANT#251: the gap is now derived from the longest possible label plus an embargo. Purge and embargo also applied to the four splits inside the weight search, with 23 passing assertions including negative controls.",
  "dead_field_printed_as_a_win_rate": "g_Calibration.bestHistoricalWR is declared once, read once, and assigned nowhere in 63,000 lines. The CATREC threshold line has always printed its default as 'calibWR'. Fixed in WARRANT#254; the dead field is left declared with a comment so the finding stays visible rather than vanishing into a clean diff."
 },

 "the_joint_statistical_finding": "C3.3 (the IC curve), C3.4 (the multiplicity ledger) and C3.6 (the uniqueness-weighted effective sample) compose into one result none produces alone: NO HORIZON of the score's IC curve survives the family-wide multiplicity correction on the effective sample. l=1 and l=2 are significant undeflated and lose to the deflated bar of 3.63 at 176 registered tests. The only survivors are two contemporaneous same-bar log-return ICs, which are explicitly not forward-predictive tests. This is the strongest form of the standing null the project has ever measured. It is NOT the edge/no-edge verdict -- C4 is that criterion, and it stops and asks.",

 "standing_lesson_from_the_day": "Almost every criterion turned out to be blocked less by missing capability than by an instrument measuring the wrong thing. C2.5's MET rested on a hedge-linter covering half its own rule, pointed at an eleven-build-stale file. C3.2's '113 of 119 guarded' was a proximity artifact. C3.1's stored line numbers pointed at unrelated code. phase0 registered 10 tests while running 110. The C1.4 definition-matcher found 7 functions in a 63,000-line file on its first run. CHECK THE INSTRUMENT AGAINST SOURCE BEFORE TRUSTING ITS VERDICT.",

